9. DEFINITIONS

"Software" means the source code, stylesheets, data files, and
documentation distributed by Antranik Agopian under the Pixelian 
name.

"Application" means any software product built using the Software,
including websites and web applications that incorporate the
Software's modules or core primitives.

"Modify" means to add to, remove from, or change the contents of any
file that ships with the Software. Adding new files without editing
